ial Services AUM Grows 17% to ₹1,19,673 Crore","description":"Mahindra Financial Services increased its Assets Under Management (AUM) to ₹1,19,673 crore, representing a 17% year-over-year growth in FY25[3].","date":"2025-12-30","source":"Mahindra Integrated Annual Report 2024-25","url":"https://www.mahindra.com/annual-report-FY2025/index.html"},{"title":"M&M Financial Services Transfers 21,022 Equity Shares Under ESOP Scheme","description":"Mahindra & Mahindra Financial Services transferred 21,022 equity shares to 10 eligible employees on December 29, 2025, under its Employee Stock Option Scheme 2010 and Restricted Stock Units Plan 2023[6].","date":"2025-12-28","source":"ScanX","url":"https://scanx.trade/stock-market-news/corporate-actions/m-m-financial-services-transfers-21-022-equity-shares-to-employees-under-esop-scheme/28558063"}]
